  "goodToKnow": "Tierisch means animal, relating to animals: tierisches Eiweiß (animal protein), tierische Produkte (relevant for vegans, a growing group in Germany). Colloquially, it's an intensifier meaning hugely or incredibly: tierisch nerven, tierisch Hunger haben, sich tierisch freuen. Das ist ja tierisch is youth slang from the 1980s. Das Tier means animal."
